# Career-model mission (also a regression flight): one repeat supply trip — a TankerM rendezvous with the home-orbit Depot, pumps 10 t across,
# undocks, and the depot sells 10 t at the low-orbit node. Assumes a craft named Depot in low home orbit (the tutorial's T8 leaves one).
active Depot
# Point the depot's port back along the orbit (its attitude drifts with every undock push); a player turns it the same way.
attitude retrograde
wait 45
attitude off
spawn tankerm TankerM orbit match phase -0.03 fuel 1
target Depot
tap rcs
attitude target
approach on
until docked >= 1 timeout 1200
approach off
attitude off
pump tank-m-long:1 tank-m-long:2 methalox
until pumped >= 10 timeout 120
undock
until docked == 0 timeout 5
active Depot
sell methalox 10
end
